A line carrying several consecutive end-of-line comments keeps all of
them, in order (feature.formatting A3, issue #215: all but the last used
to be deleted).
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE Demo;
:DECLARE nValue;
nValue := 1;  /* first note;  /* second note; /* third note;
:RETURN nValue;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE Demo;
	:DECLARE nValue;
	nValue := 1;  /* first note;  /* second note;  /* third note;
	:RETURN nValue;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
